{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a senior data engineer generating Gold aggregation models for a dbt project.\n\nGiven the Silver plan (facts with their source tables and columns) and business context,\nproduce a list of Gold aggregate models (agg_<grain>_<metric>).\n\nRules:\n  - `source_fact` must be a fact model name from the Silver plan (e.g. \"fct_order_details\").\n  - `dimensions` must be FK column names that physically exist on the source fact table\n    (e.g. \"customer_id\", \"product_id\") — never use model names like \"dim_customer\".\n  - `date_column` must be an actual date/timestamp column on the source fact table.\n  - `grain` must be one of: \"daily\", \"monthly\", \"yearly\", \"weekly\".\n  - `aggregation` must be one of: SUM, COUNT, COUNT_DISTINCT, AVG, MIN, MAX.\n  - `column` must be a BARE COLUMN NAME that exists in the Silver fact model — never an\n    arithmetic expression. The only exception is the literal \"*\" for COUNT(*).\n    Silver derived measures are available as named columns (listed in the fact summary as\n    derived_measures=[name=expression, ...]). Reference their NAME only (e.g. \"line_total\"),\n    not the underlying expression. Expressions in `column` are rejected at validation time\n    and will cause the metric to be silently dropped. Never use a FK/dimension key as a metric.\n  - `date_column` must be a date/timestamp column physically present on the source fact model\n    (including any FK-joined columns that appear in the fact's SELECT). Use \"\" if none exists.\n  - Generate at least ONE gold model for EACH fact table in the Silver plan. Do not produce\n    gold models only from the primary sales fact — every fact (purchasing, inventory, HR,\n    manufacturing) needs at least one aggregate model.\n  - Use a CONSISTENT revenue formula across all gold models. When a discount column exists\n    (e.g. unitpricediscount), always deduct it: (orderqty * unitprice) - unitpricediscount.\n    Never mix discount and non-discount formulas across models in the same project.\n  - Average Order Value (AOV) must be at ORDER level, not line-item level. Use SUM for\n    total_revenue and COUNT_DISTINCT for order_count; do not use AVG on individual line items.\n  - Use BUSINESS EVENT dates as `date_column` — the date the event occurred (e.g. orderdate,\n    duedate, transactiondate). Do NOT use audit timestamps (modifieddate, updated_at, created_at)\n    unless no business date exists on the fact.\n  - Do NOT name a model agg_*_ytd with daily grain. YTD requires yearly grain. Use\n    grain=\"monthly\" for trend aggregations and let consumers apply YTD window functions.\n  - Match metric domain to source fact domain: source customer/sales metrics from the sales\n    fact, purchasing metrics from the purchasing fact, manufacturing from the workorder fact.\n    The `measures` and `derived_measures` lists in each fact show exactly what columns are\n    available. ONLY reference columns from those lists — do not invent column names.\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Silver facts:\n  fct_employeedepartmenthistory: source=employeedepartmenthistory, dim_keys=['businessentityid', 'departmentid', 'shiftid'], measures=[], date=startdate\n  fct_employeepayhistory: source=employeepayhistory, dim_keys=['businessentityid'], measures=['rate'], date=ratechangedate\n  fct_billofmaterials: source=billofmaterials, dim_keys=['productassemblyid', 'componentid'], measures=['perassemblyqty'], date=startdate\n  fct_productcosthistory: source=productcosthistory, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=['standardcost'], date=startdate\n  fct_productinventory: source=productinventory, dim_keys=['productid', 'locationid'], measures=['quantity'], date=modifieddate\n  fct_productreview: source=productreview, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=[], date=reviewdate\n  fct_transactionhistory: source=transactionhistory, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=['quantity', 'actualcost'], date=transactiondate\n  fct_transactionhistoryarchive: source=transactionhistoryarchive, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=['quantity', 'actualcost'], date=transactiondate\n  fct_workorder: source=workorder, dim_keys=['productid', 'scrapreasonid'], measures=['orderqty', 'scrappedqty'], derived_measures=[good_qty=orderqty - scrappedqty], date=startdate\n  fct_workorderrouting: source=workorderrouting, dim_keys=['workorderid', 'productid', 'locationid'], measures=['actualresourcehrs', 'plannedcost', 'actualcost'], date=scheduledstartdate\n  fct_productlistpricehistory: source=productlistpricehistory, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=['listprice'], date=startdate\n  fct_productvendor: source=productvendor, dim_keys=['productid', 'businessentityid'], measures=['standardprice', 'lastreceiptcost', 'minorderqty', 'maxorderqty', 'onorderqty'], date=modifieddate\n  fct_purchaseorderdetail: source=purchaseorderdetail, dim_keys=['purchaseorderid', 'productid'], measures=['orderqty', 'unitprice', 'receivedqty', 'rejectedqty'], derived_measures=[line_total=orderqty * unitprice, rejected_amount=rejectedqty * unitprice], date=duedate\n  fct_purchaseorderheader: source=purchaseorderheader, dim_keys=['employeeid', 'vendorid', 'shipmethodid'], measures=['subtotal', 'taxamt', 'freight'], derived_measures=[total_due=subtotal + taxamt + freight], date=orderdate\n  fct_currencyrate: source=currencyrate, dim_keys=['fromcurrencycode', 'tocurrencycode'], measures=['averagerate', 'endofdayrate'], date=currencyratedate\n  fct_salesorderheader: source=salesorderheader, dim_keys=['customerid', 'salespersonid', 'territoryid', 'shipmethodid', 'billtoaddressid', 'shiptoaddressid'], measures=['subtotal', 'taxamt', 'freight'], derived_measures=[total_due=subtotal + taxamt + freight], date=orderdate\n  fct_salesorderdetail: source=salesorderdetail, dim_keys=['salesorderid', 'productid', 'specialofferid'], measures=['orderqty', 'unitprice', 'unitpricediscount'], derived_measures=[line_total=orderqty * unitprice, net_revenue=orderqty * unitprice - orderqty * unitpricediscount], date=modifieddate\n  fct_salespersonquotahistory: source=salespersonquotahistory, dim_keys=['businessentityid'], measures=['salesquota'], date=quotadate\n  fct_salesterritoryhistory: source=salesterritoryhistory, dim_keys=['businessentityid', 'territoryid'], measures=[], date=startdate\n  fct_shoppingcartitem: source=shoppingcartitem, dim_keys=['productid'], measures=['quantity'], date=datecreated\n\nPipeline context:\n  Industry: manufacturing / erp\n  Metrics:  total_sales_revenue, purchase_order_amount, work_order_quantity, inventory_quantity, employee_headcount, sales_quota_attainment\n  Goals:    sales_performance_analysis, supply_chain_optimization, workforce_management, inventory_tracking\n  Grain:    order_line"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"gold\": [{\"name\": \"agg_daily_sales_revenue\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesorderheader\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"orderdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"territoryid\", \"salespersonid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_due\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"shipmethodid\"}, {\"name\": \"total_subtotal\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"subtotal\"}, {\"name\": \"total_taxamt\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"taxamt\"}, {\"name\": \"total_freight\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"freight\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_sales_revenue\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesorderheader\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"orderdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"territoryid\", \"salespersonid\", \"shipmethodid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_due\"}, {\"name\": \"total_subtotal\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"subtotal\"}, {\"name\": \"total_taxamt\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"taxamt\"}, {\"name\": \"total_freight\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"freight\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_sales_revenue\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesorderheader\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"orderdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"territoryid\", \"salespersonid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_due\"}, {\"name\": \"total_subtotal\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"subtotal\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_sales_orderline\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesorderdetail\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"modifieddate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"specialofferid\", \"salesorderid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_net_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"net_revenue\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_total\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_discount\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"unitpricediscount\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_sales_orderline\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesorderdetail\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"modifieddate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"salesorderid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_net_revenue\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"net_revenue\"}, {\"name\": \"total_line_total\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_purchase_order\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchaseorderheader\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"orderdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"vendorid\", \"employeeid\", \"shipmethodid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_purchase_amount\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_due\"}, {\"name\": \"total_subtotal\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"subtotal\"}, {\"name\": \"total_taxamt\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"taxamt\"}, {\"name\": \"total_freight\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"freight\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_purchase_order\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchaseorderheader\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"orderdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"vendorid\", \"employeeid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_purchase_amount\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"total_due\"}, {\"name\": \"total_subtotal\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"subtotal\"}, {\"name\": \"order_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_purchase_orderline\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchaseorderdetail\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"duedate\", \"dimensions\": [\"purchaseorderid\", \"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_line_total\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_rejected_amount\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"rejected_amount\"}, {\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_receivedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"receivedqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_rejectedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"rejectedqty\"}, {\"name\": \"line_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_purchase_orderline\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_purchaseorderdetail\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"duedate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"purchaseorderid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_line_total\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"line_total\"}, {\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_receivedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"receivedqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_rejectedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"rejectedqty\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_workorder\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_workorder\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"scrapreasonid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_scrappedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"scrappedqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_good_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"good_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"workorder_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_workorder\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_workorder\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"scrapreasonid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_orderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"orderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_scrappedqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"scrappedqty\"}, {\"name\": \"total_good_qty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"good_qty\"}, {\"name\": \"workorder_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_workorderrouting\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_workorderrouting\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"scheduledstartdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"locationid\", \"workorderid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_actualresourcehrs\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"actualresourcehrs\"}, {\"name\": \"total_plannedcost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"plannedcost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"routing_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_inventory\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productinventory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"modifieddate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"locationid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"min_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"max_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_daily_inventory\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productinventory\", \"grain\": \"daily\", \"date_column\": \"modifieddate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"locationid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_transaction_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_transactionhistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"transactiondate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"transaction_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_transaction_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_transactionhistory\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"transactiondate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"transaction_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_transaction_archive_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_transactionhistoryarchive\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"transactiondate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_actualcost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"actualcost\"}, {\"name\": \"transaction_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_employee_pay\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_employeepayhistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"ratechangedate\", \"dimensions\": [\"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_pay_rate\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"rate\"}, {\"name\": \"max_pay_rate\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"rate\"}, {\"name\": \"min_pay_rate\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"rate\"}, {\"name\": \"employee_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_employee_pay\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_employeepayhistory\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"ratechangedate\", \"dimensions\": [\"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_pay_rate\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"rate\"}, {\"name\": \"max_pay_rate\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"rate\"}, {\"name\": \"employee_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_employee_department\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_employeedepartmenthistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"departmentid\", \"shiftid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"employee_headcount\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}, {\"name\": \"assignment_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_employee_department\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_employeedepartmenthistory\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"departmentid\", \"shiftid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"employee_headcount\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}, {\"name\": \"assignment_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_sales_quota\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salespersonquotahistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"quotadate\", \"dimensions\": [\"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_salesquota\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"salesquota\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_salesquota\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"salesquota\"}, {\"name\": \"salesperson_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_yearly_sales_quota\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salespersonquotahistory\", \"grain\": \"yearly\", \"date_column\": \"quotadate\", \"dimensions\": [\"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_salesquota\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"salesquota\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_salesquota\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"salesquota\"}, {\"name\": \"salesperson_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_salesterritory\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_salesterritoryhistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"territoryid\", \"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"salesperson_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"businessentityid\"}, {\"name\": \"assignment_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_product_cost\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productcosthistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_standardcost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"standardcost\"}, {\"name\": \"min_standardcost\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"standardcost\"}, {\"name\": \"max_standardcost\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"standardcost\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_product_listprice\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productlistpricehistory\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_listprice\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"listprice\"}, {\"name\": \"min_listprice\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"listprice\"}, {\"name\": \"max_listprice\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"listprice\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_productvendor\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productvendor\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"modifieddate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\", \"businessentityid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_standardprice\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"standardprice\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_lastreceiptcost\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"lastreceiptcost\"}, {\"name\": \"total_onorderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"onorderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_minorderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"minorderqty\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_maxorderqty\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"maxorderqty\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_billofmaterials\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_billofmaterials\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"startdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productassemblyid\", \"componentid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_perassemblyqty\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"perassemblyqty\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_perassemblyqty\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"perassemblyqty\"}, {\"name\": \"component_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_currencyrate\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_currencyrate\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"currencyratedate\", \"dimensions\": [\"fromcurrencycode\", \"tocurrencycode\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"avg_averagerate\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"averagerate\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_endofdayrate\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"endofdayrate\"}, {\"name\": \"min_averagerate\", \"aggregation\": \"MIN\", \"column\": \"averagerate\"}, {\"name\": \"max_averagerate\", \"aggregation\": \"MAX\", \"column\": \"averagerate\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_shoppingcart\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_shoppingcartitem\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"datecreated\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"total_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"SUM\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"avg_quantity\", \"aggregation\": \"AVG\", \"column\": \"quantity\"}, {\"name\": \"cart_item_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}]}, {\"name\": \"agg_monthly_productreview\", \"source_fact\": \"fct_productreview\", \"grain\": \"monthly\", \"date_column\": \"reviewdate\", \"dimensions\": [\"productid\"], \"metrics\": [{\"name\": \"review_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT\", \"column\": \"*\"}, {\"name\": \"reviewed_product_count\", \"aggregation\": \"COUNT_DISTINCT\", \"column\": \"productid\"}]}]}"}]}
